    "body": "fix on issue/298-machine-onboarding - PR #367: machine onboarding checklist, manual/source guidance, registration seams, supported-operation/fixture matrix and seven existing software-validation examples. Seven exact Windows tests passed, including the original Milling-test.step path; final docs-only quick mapping and independent documentation review passed. The PR names the pinning tests and explicit limits (including knurl and missing end-to-end lathe-tapping coverage). Software evidence is not physical-machine acceptance. Moving the reservation from claimed to in-review; ready for maintainer review/manual merge.",
